    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T19:59:23Z",
    "body": "Scope change from the maintainer, 2026-11-15. This replaces the sentence about the coloured operation icons in the issue body.\n\nHis words: \"change them to white as well.. and the text \"Milling 2d, MILLING 3D, etc etc\" need som space..\"\n\nAdded to the work:\n\n1. The operation icons of the ribbon (2D, 3D, Drill, Multi, and each other group icon) are white too. No ribbon icon keeps a colour.\n2. The group captions below the buttons (FILE, SETUP, MILLING 2D, MILLING 3D, DRILLING, MULTI-AXIS) need space. In the screenshot each caption touches the button label above it and the bottom edge of the ribbon. Give the caption row its own height with a gap above and below.\n\nAdded to \"Done means\":\n\n- Each ribbon icon is white on the gray bar.\n- Each group caption has clear space to the button label above it and to the bottom edge of the ribbon.\n- A structural test pins the caption row position against the button labels.\n",
